[gd_scene format=3]

; The Choir, west of Rimefall (map offset (278.5, -69)): a silent choir. Choristers, Votaries frozen
; mid-prayer, kneel along a sunken choir between low pews, facing the frozen organ at its east end. Footsteps
; never wake them; a hard landing close by does (the drop into the choir, a jump over a pew landing short), and
; a woken one walks slowly after the noise and strikes. Tread softly: walk past them, land far from them.
; West to the Coldstacks, east up the step to Rimefall.

